---
// Explains the strip under each project: highlighted stages were covered, dimmed ones were not.
---
<p class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-2 gap-y-1 font-mono text-[11px] text-muted-foreground">
  <span>Strip under each project:</span>
  <span class="rounded bg-primary/15 px-1.5 py-0.5 text-primary">highlighted</span>
  <span>stage covered,</span>
  <span class="rounded px-1.5 py-0.5 text-muted-foreground/80">dimmed</span>
  <span>not covered</span>
</p>
